# ── Loop lowering (split out of lower.gg) ────────────────────────────
# `for` lowering over Vector/Deque/Dict/String/range/iterator, the
# tuple-destructure / for-binding helpers, scrutinee-ownership probes,
# and `while` lowering. Moved verbatim from lower.gg as part of the
# lower.gg module split (output-neutral pure function move).
